==Etymology==
Spidermonkey is named after the [[Wikipedia:spider monkey|spider monkey]], an endangered species of monkeys, as well as being an amalgamation of words "[[Wikipedia:Spider|spider]]" and "monkey", referencing his spider-based powers and monkey-like appearance.

==Trivia==
*Aside from [[Frankenstrike]] in [[Pop-Up Trivia|pop-up trivia]], Spidermonkey was the first transformation in the [[Omnitrix]] to have a named predator, that being [[Root Shark]]s.<ref name="SS" />
**Ironically, Spidermonkey is also the first transformation to fight a Nemetrix predator in present-day setting.<ref name="TMTCP1" />
*Spidermonkey is one of the five aliens who escaped the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]; the others are [[Ghostfreak]], [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]], and [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]].
*In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Spidermonkey's voice has become higher-pitched, and now talks with monkey sounds and chirps in between words.
*Spidermonkey's appearance in ''[[The More Things Change: Part 1]]'' is the first mistransformation in '''Omniverse'''.
*Spidermonkey was conceived by [[Dwayne McDuffie]] and [[Glen Murakami]].{{Refn|[[:File:Glen and Dwayne Created Spidermonkey.png]]|group = DR}}
*During the pre-production stage of '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''', Spidermonkey had concept art drawn by [[Eric Canete]].{{Refn|[[:File:Eric Canete Designed Spidermonkey Concepts.png]]|group = EC}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with Spidermonkey's '''Omniverse''' hairstyle from [[Wikipedia:Marvel Comics|Marvel Comics]]' [[Wikipedia:Beast (comics)|Beast]].{{Refn|[[:File:OV Spidermonkey Hairstyle.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Negative Spidermonkey's color scheme in '''Omniverse''' is similar to that of Negative [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]]'s design in the same show.
*Spidermonkey was originally supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] and [[Albedo]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*Spidermonkey was originally not supposed to appear in:
**''[[If All Else Fails]]'', with his role taken by Chromastone.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/c/c5/IAEF_Script_Outline.pdf ''If All Else Fails'' Script Outline]|group = outline|name = outline}}
**''[[The Purge]]'', with his role taken by [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/7/71/The_Purge_Script_Outline.pdf ''The Purge'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
*Spidermonkey is one of [[Man of Action]]'s favorite aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Spidermonkey One of MoA's Faves.png]]|group = DR}}
*Spidermonkey is one of [[Dee Bradley Baker]]'s favorite aliens to voice, the other being [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]].{{Refn|[[:File:DBB's Favorite Aliens to Voice.png]]|group = DBB}}{{Refn|[[:File:Spidermonkey is One Of DBB's Favorite Aliens.png]]|group = DBB}}
*Spidermonkey's powers and personality are similar to those of Marvel Comics superhero [[Wikipedia:Spider-Man|Spider-Man]].

